WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu begins with two crouching light punches.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.050
Light Donkey Kick sends Ken away.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.700
Ryu begins a separate Denjin charge after recovering from the kick.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.550
Ryu charges while Ken is down at a distance.

5
